<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 22.25 pct, 3-mo 22.11 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 22.25 pct, 3-mo 22.11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) was unchanged for the one-month maturity and dropped 0.01 percentage points for three-month, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Friday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 22.25 percent and the three-month rate at 22.11 percent, the NBH said on its  BUBOR Reuters page.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
